<title>USA: City Holding Co sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>City Holding Co sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, W. Va. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Holding Co said its board has declared a special 10 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The 10 percent stock dividend is payable November 30, record November 1.</p>
<p>Cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
</text>
